  "sections": [
    {
      "id": 2025000,
      "startingMessageId": [
        202500000
      ],
      "messages": {
        "202500000": {
          "id": 202500000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "地址：庇爾波因特星際和平公司策略投資部，真珠個人工作室•3F。",
          "next": [
            202500001
          ]
        },
        "202500001": {
          "id": 202500001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "{NICKNAME}，往後星穹列車如有打算棄置的毀損物或廢物，可以寄給我，我會回收。",
          "next": [
            202500002,
            202500005
          ]
        },
        "202500002": {
          "id": 202500002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "這是你的副業嗎？",
          "next": [
            202500003
          ]
        },
        "202500003": {
          "id": 202500003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "副業的定義是：在主要職業之外，利用業餘時間從事且有經濟收入的第二職業。",
          "next": [
            202500004
          ]
        },
        "202500004": {
          "id": 202500004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "但嚴格來說，「廢物回收計畫」是由我付費給你們。",
          "next": [
            202500009
          ]
        },
        "202500005": {
          "id": 202500005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "廢物？哪裡有廢物？人可以回收嗎？",
          "next": [
            202500006
          ]
        },
        "202500006": {
          "id": 202500006,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "next": [
            202500007
          ]
        },
        "202500007": {
          "id": 202500007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "嚴格來說，有機生命也可以「廢物再造」。只是回收報價，不在我的預算之內。",
          "next": [
            202500008
          ]
        },
        "202500008": {
          "id": 202500008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "但其餘物品，我的回收預算充足。",
          "next": [
            202500009
          ]
        },
        "202500009": {
          "id": 202500009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "回收廢物，然後進行收藏嗎？",
          "next": [
            202500010
          ]
        },
        "202500010": {
          "id": 202500010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "是收藏前的步驟。對我來說，修復過去的物品，更像一場「說修就修的顱內旅行」。",
          "next": [
            202500011
          ]
        },
        "202500011": {
          "id": 202500011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "在「諸世界重建計畫」的工作過程中，我修復過許多無主的遺產。",
          "next": [
            202500012
          ]
        },
        "202500012": {
          "id": 202500012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "當我一點一點拼合它們的紋理，一顆陌生星球的資訊，就會湧入我的腦海——風鈴、淺灘、冰川，和更多難以言喻的文明與風景。",
          "next": [
            202500013
          ]
        },
        "202500013": {
          "id": 202500013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "通常在那之後，我會沉浸在工作裡很長一段時間。",
          "next": [
            202500014,
            202500016,
            202500019
          ]
        },
        "202500014": {
          "id": 202500014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "真羨慕你的愛好……",
          "next": [
            202500015
          ]
        },
        "202500015": {
          "id": 202500015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "竟然就是工作而已",
          "next": [
            202500020
          ]
        },
        "202500016": {
          "id": 202500016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "跟你們工作狂拼了",
          "next": [
            202500017
          ]
        },
        "202500017": {
          "id": 202500017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "「拼」豆嗎？",
          "next": [
            202500018
          ]
        },
        "202500018": {
          "id": 202500018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "開個玩笑。",
          "next": [
            202500020
          ]
        },
        "202500019": {
          "id": 202500019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "修復萬物不如行萬里路，暫停工作！去旅行！",
          "next": [
            202500020
          ]
        },
        "202500020": {
          "id": 202500020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "這讓我想起，媒體曾問過我的一個問題：您如何在工作與生活之間找到平衡？",
          "next": [
            202500021
          ]
        },
        "202500021": {
          "id": 202500021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "首先，我建議他：問問路易士•弗萊明。其次，我回答他：你如何平衡呼吸和活著？他沒有再追問了。",
          "next": [
            202500022
          ]
        },
        "202500022": {
          "id": 202500022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "再者：修復星穹列車廢置的或沿途拾取的毀損物，也是一種感受「開拓」的藝術之旅。",
          "next": [
            202500023
          ]
        },
        "202500023": {
          "id": 202500023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "對了，一個熱知識：大海裡的珍珠，也是一種「廢物再造」。",
          "next": [
            202500024
          ]
        },
        "202500024": {
          "id": 202500024,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "next": [
            202500025
          ]
        },
        "202500025": {
          "id": 202500025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "這筆私人交易長期有效，期待星穹列車寄來的「旅行好物」。",
          "next": []
        }
      },
      "participatingContactsIds": [
        1503,
        8001
      ]
    }
  ]
}